# Project Tech Stack
- PHP Version: 8.2
- Framework: Laravel 11.x (Vite build system)
- Node.js Version: 24.x
- Frontend: Vue 3 (Composition API / <script setup>), A-Frame (WebVR)

# Coding Standards & Guidelines
- Follow PSR-12 for all PHP / Laravel code.
- Use Laravel 11 structure (Route files in routes/web.php, configuration in config/ or env).
- Write Vue 3 components using <script setup> and Composition API.
- Keep A-Frame components integrated safely with Vue lifecycle hooks (onMounted / onUnmounted).

# Response Instructions
- Provide exact, runnable code without skipping necessary imports or setup.
- Avoid verbose explanations or reasoning text. Output direct implementation code.
- Answer directly with final code. Minimize internal reasoning text to save output tokens.